bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Update new password

control AuthService
control UserService
boundary HashUtil
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

AuthService -> HashUtil: 1. hashPassword(password)
activate HashUtil
activate AuthService
HashUtil --> AuthService: 2. hashed password
deactivate HashUtil
AuthService -> UserService: 3. changePasswordForgot(newPassword, email)
activate UserService
UserService -> UserModel: 4. update password
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 5. update document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 6. result
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 7. return result
deactivate UserModel
UserService --> AuthService: 8. return result
deactivate UserService
deactivate AuthService